{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41395","headline":"溧水无相寺赠僧 · 韩熙载","name":"溧水无相寺赠僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无相景幽远，山屏四面开。\n凭师领鹤去，待我挂冠来。\n药爲依时采，松宜绕舍栽。\n林泉自多兴，不是效刘雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩熙载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}